quo;polite system prompts&amp;rdquo; — sever every branch in deterministic code!&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="920" height="1150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="hdr_T164" value="&lt;div style='width:678px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='display:inline-block;background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;font-size:10.8px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:6px;'&gt;BLUEPRINT #75 (T164) • LINKEDIN APPSEC &amp; CISO VIRAL HIT • ATTACK TREE + SHIELDS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:35px;font-weight:900;color:#0F172A;letter-spacing:-0.85px;line-height:1.08;'&gt;AI Threat Model: &lt;span style='color:#DC2626;'&gt;Attack T.H.R.E.A.T. Tree&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:14.5px;font-weight:500;color:#334155;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.25;'&gt;Assume prompts can be jailbroken — sever every &lt;b&gt;[OR]&lt;/b&gt; attack branch with deterministic &lt;b&gt;T.H.R.E.A.T.&lt;/b&gt; shields&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="18" width="682" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

